# Vectors of tests/data/sst68030_fpu2 (two instructions each, strict oracle) on
# which the fork does not follow the oracle. See tests/SstKnown.h for the
# rules: a listed vector that passes, or is missing, fails the gate.

# No legacy name-only entries. The 21 vectors listed on 2026-11-07 (D23b) pass since
# the ruling was applied the same day.

# D23a (2026-11-16): MC68030UM-1989 Figure 10-45 uses format 2 and
# the F-line instruction address. The oracle instead emits format 3/EA.
# These tagged entries normalize only those frame bytes; the entire final
# state is still compared, and a stale oracle frame fails the gate.
